// 4 Caption :
"P3675376314" "<x=0.7 y=0.7 t=5 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Red>He's here.  He's going to do it... I just know it."
// 0 Caption :
"P3418387278" "<x=0.7 y=0.7 t=5 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Red>I need to shift us all out of here right now!  Just retreating isn't enough..."
// 0 Tyrant :
"P1009484493" "<goto=Cutscene face=TyrantFacing>"
// 4 Caption :
"P972417430" "<x=0.525 y=0.15 t=4 d=3><scale 1.75><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>You dare to stand before me?!?"
// 0 Tyrant :
"P2625250618" "<em=frustrated>"
// 4 Caption :
"P2817432475" "<x=0.525 y=0.15 t=4 d=3><scale 1.75><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>You, who have ruined my home and destroyed all that I sought to protect?!?"
// 4 Caption :
"P96174644" "<x=0.525 y=0.15 t=4 d=3><scale 1.75><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>I am left with no choice... You are strong adversaries."
// 4 Caption :
"P1609645663" "<x=0.525 y=0.15 t=4 d=3><scale 1.75><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>I will use what is left of this world... To gain the power necessary to fight that which comes!"
// 4 Caption :
"P1516396656" "<x=0.525 y=0.15 t=3 d=2><scale 1.75><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>Do you hear that?"
// 4 Caption :
"P1175321572" "<x=0.525 y=0.15 t=3 d=2><scale 1.75><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>I have grown stronger yet since I last felt a blast of this force..."
// 0 Caption :
"P1400923852" "<x=0.525 y=0.15 t=3 d=2><scale 1.75><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>Let us see how you weather this storm!"
// 4 Caption :
"P2022544320" "<x=0.5 y=0.5 t=5 d=4><scale 1.75><color Yellow><bgcolor DarkRed>By the power of Tartarus, I call upon the souls of the dead!"

