// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Desdemona 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1441659146" "Oh good, you're here! I was starting to get worried that you'd not make it back before we were completely overwhelmed!"
// Answer Text :
"P2029813891" "How bad is it?"
// Page DesdemonaSituation Text :
"P1409797548" "It's really, really bad… like, end of the world bad. Almost all of my people have been expended just trying to hold back Tyrant, but it seems to be for nothing, because I can hear the Hamidon's forces gathering beyond the fences. That nutjob Calvin Scott and those Talons have pretty much doomed everyone on Praetoria. If Tyrant doesn't get us, the Hamidon will."
// Answer Text :
"P1480566491" "What's the plan?"
// Page DesdemonaPlan Text :
"P3399129979" "Aurora and I have been coordinating with Dream Doctor and Dominatrix. Dominatrix says she is capable of transporting many of us to Primal Earth… somehow. I don't really know the details, but it’s the only chance we've got.<br><br>So, right now, our plan is to evacuate as many as possible from Praetoria as quickly as we can, while you do what you came here to do: defeat Tyrant and get the hell out before the Hamidon breaches the fences."
// Answer Text :
"P116329829" ""Alright, Desdemona. Good luck."
// DisplayName for Desdemona :
"P3638897958" "Desdemona"

