"P174591553" "Why are you here?"
// Page DominatrixPlan Text :
"P2191982498" "Because you're going to need me if we want to get anyone out of there. Now, go, go talk to Doc so we can get into Praetoria!"
// Answer Text :
"P1230545719" "Doc? You mean Dream Doctor, right?"
// Page DominatrixClose Text :
"P2489383446" "<color Red>Dominatrix gives you an exasperated look.</color><br><br>Yes… Dream Doctor. Look, just go talk to him, OK?"
