// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Dominatrix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1139411547" "What are you doing standing here talking to me? You need to get out there and stop him!"
// Answer Text :
"P1221969313" "What are you planning on doing?"
// Page DominatrixPlan Text :
"P282781871" "The best way I can help you now is to make sure I help get as many people out of here as I can, as quickly as I can."
// Answer Text :
"P3553145167" "Why? What is the hurry?"
// Page DominatrixRush Text :
"P1484540253" "What's the hurry? You mean besides the Hamidon bearing down on the city? You mean besides the destruction Calvin Scott and the Talons are causing everywhere?<br><br>Look, I know my grandfather. When you show up, you'll just steamroll through his remaining people, and that's when he'll get mad. And I don't know if you can withstand that."
// Answer Text :
"P1414903233" "Why? What do you think he'll do?"
// Page DominatrixOmen Text :
"P1231423812" "All I know is that he knows what he can survive. He's done it before, and I think he's been pushed to the point where he will do it again.<br><br>Now please, let me focus. I promised I'd help you, and for once, I'm true to my word. I need to be ready in case my grandfather decides to do the unthinkable."
// Answer Text :
"P1175134909" "OK. Good luck, Dominatrix."
// DisplayName for Dominatrix :

