// Page Intro Text :
"P3729297411" "Dream Doctor is channelling powerful magical energies throughout this space."
// Answer Text :
"P2300736455" "Where are we?"
// Page DreamExposition Text :
"P1804863815" "We're outside of space and time!  I'm preparing a transportation ritual that will take us to the assault on Tyrant's tower."
// Answer Text :
"P3996938203" "What do we need to know?"
// Page NextSteps Text :
"P2881987024" "Lord Recluse and his lieutenants attacked the Magisterium and were soundly defeated.  Tyrant flew off after the battle and has not been seen in several hours.  In the chaotic aftermath of Arachnos' attack, this is our chance to secure Tyrant's tower!  Let me know when you're prepared for the assault, and I'll send you in!"
// Answer Text :
"P2531389164" "We're ready, Dream Doctor!"
// DisplayName for DreamDoctor :
"P4223889483" "Dream Doctor"

